flare-tools (1.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Go implementation of flare-tools
  * Convert from Ruby to Go with full protocol compatibility
  * Add flare-admin for cluster management operations
  * Add flare-stats for monitoring cluster statistics
  * Support all administrative commands (master, slave, reconstruct, etc.)
  * Add comprehensive unit tests and e2e tests
  * Add dry-run support for destructive operations

